 Feature exerciser — graphemes and scripts                                                                              
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
                                                                                                                        
 Everything here exists to stress the width machinery: every rendered row must still be exactly the requested width,    
 and no cluster may ever be split.                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
 Double-width scripts                                                                                                   
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 日本語のテキストと English が混ざった段落です。中文、한국어、そして日本語。 全角のスペース　と半角のスペース           
 の違いも確認します。                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
 Right to left                                                                                                          
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 مرحبا بالعالم — هذه فقرة بالعربية مختلطة مع English في نفس السطر. שלום עולם — וזו פסקה בעברית עם English בתוכה.        
                                                                                                                        
 Indic and combining marks                                                                                              
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 नमस्ते दुनिया — देवनागरी में एक वाक्य। ไทย: สวัสดีชาวโลก (no spaces between words). Combining: café (decomposed) and café       
 (precomposed), q̈ and a̐ and e⃝. A base with many marks: x̧̨̛̋̈́͢.                                                               
                                                                                                                        
 Emoji                                                                                                                  
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 Simple: 👍 ☕ ✅ Skin tone: 👍🏽 👋🏿 ZWJ family: 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 ZWJ profession: 👩‍💻 🧑‍🚀 Flags: 🇨🇭 🇯🇵 🇺🇳 Keycap: 1️⃣ #️⃣ Variation         
 selectors: ❤️ versus ❤ and ✔️ versus ✔                                                                                 
                                                                                                                        
 Wider than two columns                                                                                                 
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 The one scalar in Unicode wider than two columns is U+17D8 KHMER SIGN BEYYAL, which measures three: �   — here it is   
 alone, �  �  �   three in a row, and inside a sentence that has to wrap around it at forty columns �   like so.        
                                                                                                                        
 A Tangut base plus a spacing Tai Tham mark, one grapheme of three columns: 𗀀ᩗ                                         
                                                                                                                        
 Zero width and invisible                                                                                               
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 A zero-width space: a​b. A zero-width joiner between letters: a‍b. A soft hyphen: super­cali­fragilistic. A word joiner:   
 a⁠b. A non-breaking space: a b. A narrow no-break space: 1 000.                                                         
                                                                                                                        
 Control-ish and unusual                                                                                                
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 A tab between words. A form feed is not included because it is not text. Surrogate-free astral text: 𝕳𝖊𝖑𝖑𝖔 𝖜𝖔𝖗𝖑𝖉 and   
 𝟙𝟚𝟛. Enclosed alphanumerics: ⑴ ⒜ ㊙ ㈱.                                                                                
                                                                                                                        
